      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.57,
      "end_seconds": 276.14,
      "duration_seconds": 7.57,
      "text": "There is a new murmur, small splinter lines under the nails and a tender spot on the finger pad."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.38,
      "end_seconds": 285.68,
      "duration_seconds": 7.3,
      "text": "You can sit up now. Okay, thinking it through, this looks most like possible infective endocarditis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 286.88,
      "end_seconds": 290.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Um, do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.49,
      "end_seconds": 305.38,
      "duration_seconds": 13.89,
      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to an emergency it looks like possible infective endocarditis, but I'd like to confirm i want an echocardiogram done, that's for new murmur"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 307.48,
      "end_seconds": 311.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "we have a slot Monday at 9 am, if that works"
    },
